{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/pulls/4325","id":4684380052,"node_id":"PR_kwDOPuAjtM8AAAABFzX3lA","html_url":"https://github.com/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/pull/4325","diff_url":"https://github.com/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/pull/4325.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/pull/4325.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/issues/4325","number":4325,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(OMN-17427): bump pyjwt to 2.15.1, the lockfile CVE scan fails every merge-group run","user":{"login":"jonahgabriel","id":1002253,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDIyNTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1002253?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel","html_url":"https://github.com/jonahgabriel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonahgabriel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Why\n\n`Lockfile CVE Scan (OMN-16228)` fails every `merge_group` run on `dev` since the PyJWT advisories published against 2.13.0: six HIGH/CRITICAL findings with an upstream fix available (GHSA-9j54-fg26-wv3r, GHSA-9v7f-9g4p-ffgj, GHSA-ffc3-869f-jxw9 critical, GHSA-p4g4-x82p-q773, GHSA-r6x4-923q-g947, GHSA-w2cx-738m-mc7w). Read from the merge-group job log of run 36652218019 at 00:51Z. The merge queue then removes the entry with reason failed_checks: omnibase_infra#4304, #4317 and #4319 were each removed twice between 00:23Z and 00:49Z for this reason. The pull_request runs stay green, so no PR shows it before it is queued.\n\n## Change\n\n- `pyproject.toml`: the PyJWT security floor goes from `>=2.13.0` to `>=2.15.1`, with the advisory ids in the comment.\n- `uv.lock`: `uv lock --upgrade-package pyjwt` resolves 2.13.0 to 2.15.1 (only that package moves).\n\n## Local proof\n\n`uv lock` output: `Updated pyjwt v2.13.0 -> v2.15.1`. Focused tests are run on a lab host (see the comment below).\n\nTicket: OMN-17427\n\n\n## Runner image identity\n\nThe lock change moves the shared env digest, so `docker/runners/runner-image.lock.json` is regenerated with `scripts/ci/runner_image_identity.py --mode generate` (verify mode passes).\n\nEvidence-Ticket: OMN-17427\nEvidence-Source: OCC#11857\n\n","created_at":"2026-09-30T01:01:10Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T04:06:36Z","closed_at":"2026-09-30T03:47:12Z","merged_at":"2026-09-30T03:47:12Z","merge_commit_sha":"6f670788566b13ceec90daba0978b2d12bbf054f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/pulls/4325/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/pulls/4325/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/issues/4325/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/statuses/84310433bc8f752dfaac7eb301e92c71dac2a3ab","head":{"label":"OmniNode-ai:jonah/omn-17427-pyjwt-cve-lockfile","ref":"jonah/omn-17427-pyjwt-cve-lockfile","sha":"84310433bc8f752dfaac7eb301e92c71dac2a3ab","user":{"login":"OmniNode-ai","id":209038818,"node_id":"O_kgDODHWt4g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209038818?v=4","grava